.TH factor 1 (date) "GNU coreutils (unreleased)"
.SH NAME
factor \- factor numbers
.SH Synopsis
.SY factor
.RI [ OPTION ]
.RI [ NUMBER \~.\|.\|.\&]
.YS
.SH Description
Print the prime factors of each specified integer NUMBER.  If none
are specified on the command line, read them from standard input.
.TP
.UR https://www.gnu.org/software/coreutils/manual/coreutils.html#factor\-h
\fB\-h, \-\-exponents\fP
.UE
print repeated factors in form p^e unless e is 1
.TP
.UR https://www.gnu.org/software/coreutils/factor#factor\-\-help
\fB\-\-help\fP
.UE
display this help and exit
.TP
.UR https://www.gnu.org/software/coreutils/factor#factor\-\-version
\fB\-\-version\fP
.UE
output version information and exit
